+### E1 Catena correction V3 — 2026-08-12
+
+The independent review of correction V2 (`4c30d86f7118d69eb27d12dc9b63568e531918eb`, branch
+`review/catena-wave-1-e1-corrections-v2-independent`) dispositioned the
